OL,3,GNEWSATown's flood defence work start
OL,4,Adelayed until 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn #81m flood alleviation scheme for
OL,7,FHebden Bridge is now unlikely to start
OL,8,Funtil 2028, the Environment Agency (EA)
OL,9,Fhas confirmed.
OL,11,FEarlier this year Calderdale Council's
OL,12,Fapproved the plans to build new flood
OL,13,Fwalls and vertical rising barriers in
OL,14,Fthe town, as well as repairing and
OL,15,Frebuilding existing defences.
OL,17,FHebden Bridge was severely hit by
OL,18,Fflooding in 2000, 2006, 2012, 2015 and
OL,19,F2020.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
